    {
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### RCM Guardian — Denial forecasting\n\nMetrics are emitted by the API at **`/metrics`** (Prometheus scrapes `rcm-guardian-api`). Histogram **`rcm_auditor_confidence`** records post-audit scores; **`rcm_finding_total`** counts structured findings (`finding_kind`, `status`); **`rcm_route_human_review_total`** counts HITL interrupts; **`rcm_graph_duration_seconds`** times LangGraph nodes (`node` label).\n\nRun documents through **`POST /v1/process`** to populate series.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(rcm_auditor_confidence_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(rcm_auditor_confidence_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Mean auditor confidence",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Auditor confidence trend",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(rcm_finding_total{finding_kind=\"PRIOR_AUTH_GAP\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Prior-auth gaps / sec",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(rcm_route_human_review_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HITL interrupts / sec",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Denial-risk signals (PA gaps vs HITL)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short"},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "id": 4,
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(rcm_finding_total{finding_kind=\"PRIOR_AUTH_GAP\",status=\"REJECTED\"}[24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "24h PA-gap findings (REJECTED)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1}},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 13},
      "id": 5,
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["mean"]}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(rcm_auditor_confidence_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(rcm_auditor_confidence_count[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Mean confidence (rolling)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
